  METHOD refresh_current_msg.
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* SBB AG, SAP CCC-IT, Bern
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* Beschreibung: Result Set der Selektion holen
*
* SAP-Prozess/process : ...
* Grund/reason: ( ) QM-Meldung/QM ticket  : ...
*               (X) Projekt/ project      : 5784:UMGT:Überwachungsmanagement.
*               ( ) Notkorrektur/ emergency correction: ...
*               ( ) OSS-Hinweis/note      : ...
*               ( ) OSS-Meldung/message   : ...
*               ( ) andere/other          : ...
*
* Auftraggeber/ ordered by: Rolf Wahle / Gregor Tanner
*
*--------------Änderungsdokumentation/ documentation of changes--------*
* Version SAP-Rel    Datum/date        Entwickler/developer
*         Beschreibung/ description
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* >000<   7.50       15.06.2018        T-Systems RUS / Evgeny Sharipov
*         Programmerstellung/ creation of Methode
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
    IF mv_log_handle IS NOT INITIAL.

      CALL FUNCTION 'BAL_LOG_MSG_DELETE_ALL'
        EXPORTING
          i_log_handle  = mv_log_handle
        EXCEPTIONS
          log_not_found = 1
          OTHERS        = 2.

      IF sy-subrc = 1.
        RAISE log_not_found.
      ENDIF.

    ENDIF.
  ENDMETHOD.


* <SIGNATURE>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
* | Instance Public Method zcl_appl_log->SAVE
* +-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
* +--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</SIGNATURE>
METHOD save.
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*

  DATA: ls_statistics            TYPE          bal_s_scnt.
  DATA: lt_object_with_lognumber TYPE TABLE OF balnri.

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*

  CALL FUNCTION 'BAL_LOG_HDR_READ'
    EXPORTING
      i_log_handle = mv_log_handle
    IMPORTING
      e_statistics = ls_statistics.

  CHECK ls_statistics-msg_cnt_al > 1.

  CALL FUNCTION 'APPL_LOG_WRITE_DB'
    EXPORTING
      log_handle            = mv_log_handle
      update_task           = 'X'
    TABLES
      object_with_lognumber = lt_object_with_lognumber.

ENDMETHOD.
